# Fire TV device dumps pulled off the box for research: Amazon's proprietary
# APKs, plus dumpsys/getprop output that carries the device serial number and
# the remote's Bluetooth MAC. Kept locally, never committed. The README that
# describes what was pulled is fine to track.
pulled/*
!pulled/README.md

# Sony's XMB icons, extracted from the source sheet. Personal theming only.
icons/ps3-extracted/
# App signing. The keystore IS the app's identity: losing it means never being able
# to update an install signed with it, and leaking it means someone else can. Neither
# the key nor the passwords are ever committed.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
!debug.keystore
!keystore.properties.example
